{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/427b8977966e05615514112fc866d357.avif?t=1773683942\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras_big/427b8977966e05615514112fc866d357.webp?t=1773683942 width=1560 height=587 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abigail</strong> is a <strong>narrative-driven adventure</strong> about memory, change, and the way places shape the people who leave them behind. Featuring a <strong>richly crafted world</strong>, a <strong>unique evolving folk game</strong>, and <strong>a deeply personal story</strong>. As you explore Abigail\u2019s tactile hometown, grapple with a past that doesn\u2019t exist anymore, and flickers of a future that doesn\u2019t belong to her.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before she left, Abigail was the unspoken center of her friend group\u2014Chase, Dani, Joanna, Gabe, and Kate, her first love. Now, returning to Kiln, she finds them changed, just as she is. Rekindle old friendships, uncover buried tensions, and decide what kind of place Kiln will hold in Abigail\u2019s life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/dbe3c1dc45b02d60024fe925d085672e.avif?t=1773683942\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras_big/dbe3c1dc45b02d60024fe925d085672e.webp?t=1773683942 width=1560 height=587 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through Kiln Bay\u2019s tactile streets. Every surface - felt, clay, collage, papier-mache, and glass - is captured through a blend of photogrammetry, stop motion, and a quiet touch of magic. The city feels alive, stitched together from handmade memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/7636c4c98c99e6a7a846b0ca7277d427.poster.avif?t=1773683942\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/7636c4c98c99e6a7a846b0ca7277d427.webm?t=1773683942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/7636c4c98c99e6a7a846b0ca7277d427.mp4?t=1773683942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/a3cc45bc0d6e7232775696591e3911bd.avif?t=1773683942\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras_big/a3cc45bc0d6e7232775696591e3911bd.webp?t=1773683942 width=1560 height=587 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Azulejo tiles are reflections of the people, places, and moments of Kiln Bay. Each tile carries traces of its origin\u2014an overheard story, a fragment of history, a friendship long faded. Gather them by interacting with this tactile world, uncovering its secrets, and developing bonds with its characters. The eccentric Gianluca hands out tiles so you can rep his local pizzeria, while reliving your haunted house adventures, conjures a spooky ghost Azulejo. Each tile is not only a crystallization of nostalgia, but a way to connect with the neighbors you grew up alongside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/7e26c7233f7e39d76d2c7ba484409881.poster.avif?t=1773683942\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/7e26c7233f7e39d76d2c7ba484409881.webm?t=1773683942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/7e26c7233f7e39d76d2c7ba484409881.mp4?t=1773683942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/7c9aa4dbc0d05ffcd3413b169ee1d5b3.avif?t=1773683942\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras_big/7c9aa4dbc0d05ffcd3413b169ee1d5b3.webp?t=1773683942 width=1560 height=587 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Azulejo is a trading card game with no numbers and ever-shifting rules that change from neighborhood to neighborhood. It\u2019s a folk game woven through the city\u2019s culture, taking on forms as varied as affectionate conversations, mystical divination, catalysts for magical events, this-or-that party games, and collaborative artmaking with world-altering consequences. Now, a hyper-competitive corporatized version Power Azulejo\u2122\u2014slick, high-stakes, and rapidly sweeping the city\u2014threatens to erase the vibrant idiosyncrasies of the folk variations that birthed it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/f0f9485dff701f3c75859178a2d50739.poster.avif?t=1773683942\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/f0f9485dff701f3c75859178a2d50739.webm?t=1773683942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/f0f9485dff701f3c75859178a2d50739.mp4?t=1773683942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversations with Kiln Bay\u2019s residents flow like games themselves\u2014shifting, playful and alive. Your words and your tiles intertwine, turning dialogue into discovery, memory into meaning, and strangers into friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/8422b8bf507f249e484d8f7a4684991e.poster.avif?t=1773683942\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/8422b8bf507f249e484d8f7a4684991e.webm?t=1773683942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/8422b8bf507f249e484d8f7a4684991e.mp4?t=1773683942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock opponents out of the arena in the newest and shiniest version of Azulejo. Every tile has a unique power, and a competitive scene is growing across Kiln Bay. Not everyone is so enthused by this new phenomenon, with many old timers refusing to embrace it. With the very first Power Azulejo tournament on the horizon, will your collection measure up or will you join the detractors?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/18133cf4f05ab8008f2e13aeda206501.poster.avif?t=1773683942\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/18133cf4f05ab8008f2e13aeda206501.webm?t=1773683942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/18133cf4f05ab8008f2e13aeda206501.mp4?t=1773683942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/imag